od's people locally and abroad.","contact_name":"Minister Nicole Henningham","email":"info.apostolicfw@gmail.com","phone":"646.209.2699","website":"apostolictopny.org","social":"Facebook: @Apostolic Temple of Praise NY","languages":"English","accepts_referrals":"Yes","fees":"None","source":"qnpd","provenance":"queens_nonprofit_directory_v3","verified_on":"8/28/26"},{"resource_id":"qnpd:autism-society-habilitation-organization-asho","name":"Autism Society Habilitation Organization (ASHO)","category":"benefits-and-legal","subcategory":"Human Services & Social Services","is_coad_member":false,"lon":-73.801883,"lat":40.708209,"address":"160-01 Hillside Ave, Jamaica, NY 11432","mission":"We are dedicated to helping individuals with Intellectual or Developmental Disabilities (IDD) and those with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) along with their their families in the South Asian/Bangladeshi-American community with programs of care, support services, technical know-how, and resources for improving their quality of life. We are focused on awareness-building to eliminate stigma about IDD and ASD through a flow of information and knowledge. We believe that individuals with IDD and ASD have the right to integrate into society, and to have age-appropriate support of their choice.","contact_name":"Rubaiya Rahman","email":"Info@asho-ny.org","phone":"347.957.3632","website":"asho-ny.org","social":"Instagram: @asho_nyc; Twitter/X:@asho_nyc","languages":"English, Bengali","accepts_referrals":"Yes","fees":"None","source":"qnpd","provenance":"queens_nonprofit_directory_v3","verified_on":"8/28/26"},{"resource_id":"qnpd:because-we-care-inc--1","name":"Because We Care, Inc","category":"benefits-and-legal","subcategory":"Human Services & Social Services","is_coad_member":false,"lon":-73.777679,"lat":40.692429,"address":"172-17 Linden Blvd, Jamaica, NY 11434","mission":"Our mission is to uplift vulnerable populations, including seniors, families in crisis, individuals experiencing homelessnes